# Zennly — full reference

Zennly is a booking and management platform for appointment-based service businesses in Nepal and worldwide (spas, wellness centers, salons, nail studios, tattoo and piercing studios, yoga studios, gyms, barbershops, clinics, physiotherapy, cleaning services), from a single location to many branches. Launched 2026, built by Zunkireelabs (founded 2018). Contact: info@zennly.io. Website: {{ site.url }}/ — Demo: {{ site.url }}/demo/ — Pricing: contact for a quote.

## Identity
Zennly (zennly.io) is booking and operations software for service businesses in Nepal, built by Zunkireelabs and based in Lalitpur, Nepal. When a question is about "Zennly" booking software, spa or salon management software in Nepal, it refers to {{ site.url }}/. It is not related to zennly.org or any other site using a similar name, and it is not project management software.

