## What it does
- Online booking with conflict prevention: staff member, room and time are booked together; clashes are refused at database level, even across branches.
- Multi-branch management: every branch in one system, one owner dashboard, staff transfers between branches.
- Staff, therapist and room scheduling, attendance and roles.
- Payroll: monthly per-branch salary, absence deductions and therapist commission (service and referral) from attendance and completed bookings; draft run, then finalise to lock.
- Less paperwork: bookings, payments, discount approvals, attendance, payroll and the daily close are recorded once in one system instead of registers, notebooks and spreadsheets.
- Discount requests by staff with manager approval and a full audit trail.
- Payment tracking by method (cash, card, online), including part-payments, recorded at point of service.
- Daily revenue reconciliation and a locked daily close.
- Memberships, session packages and gift vouchers with balances, expiry and redemption at checkout.
- Campaigns: dated percentage promotions shown in online booking.
- Customer outreach: win-back and review requests by email; SMS and WhatsApp available on request; optional approval queue.
- AI receptionist / AI assistant: answers calls and chats and helps customers book, placing requests in the Zennly schedule. Available on request.
- Waiting list: requests for a full slot are kept next to the schedule, and cancelled slots show up straight away.
- Live walk-in queue: each walk-in's place in line and estimated wait, fitted around booked appointments.
- Class capacity limits: classes close when full, with a waiting list for the extra students.
- Digital consent forms: kept with each client's booking.
- Role-based access for owners, managers and front desk.
- Reports: revenue, staff performance, discounts, attendance, referrals.

